          "The Nucleus: Nucleus is a large organelle that houses most of a cell\u2019s deoxyribonucleic acid (DNA). Within the nucleus, each chromosome, a single molecule of DNA associated with several proteins, contains thousands of hereditary units called \u2018genes\u2019 that control most aspects of cellular structure and function.",
