        "clinicalPearl": "**Clinical Pearl:** Ulcerative colitis: Ulcerative colitis is an inflammatory bowel disease (IBD), characterized by the inflammation and ulcerative aberrations in the wall of the large intestine. It is also known as \u2018colitis or proctitis\u2019. Rectum and lower part of the colon are commonly affected. Sometimes, the entire colon is affected. Ulcerative colitis can occur at any age. Commonly, it affects people in the age group of 15 to 30 years. Rarely it affects 50 to 70 years old people",
