        "clinicalPearl": "**Clinical Pearl:** Celiac disease: Celiac disease is an autoimmune disorder characterized by the damage of mucosa and atrophy of villi in small intestine, resulting in impaired digestion and absorption. It is also known as \u2018gluten-sensitive enteropathy\u2019, celiac sprue and nontropical sprue.",
