          "Size:  It is 2.5 cm. thick, 7.5 cm. broad and 12.5 cm. long.",
          "Shape: Shaped like a shoe.",
          "Figure 5.20: Structure of the spleen.",
          "Blood Supply to the Spleen: Both the short gastric arteries and the splenic artery supply it with blood.",
          "Nerve Supply to the Spleen: The nerves accompany the splenic artery and are derived from the celiac plexus."
