          "External jugular vein: This vein begins near the angle of mandible by the union of the posterior division of retromandibular vein and the posterior auricular vein about 2 cm. above the clavicle.",
          "Dural venous sinuses: Venous blood from the deep areas of the brain drain into dural venous sinuses. These are venous channels enclosed within the cranial dura matter.",
