        "answer": "INC standard: Detail anatomical landmarks, physiological mechanisms, and clinical nursing management for Flexor carpi and extensor carpi: muscles originate on the bones of the forearm and insert on the bones of the hand. The \ufb02exors carpi \ufb02ex the wrists and hands, and the extensor carpi extend the wrists and hands..",
