          "Venous Drainage of the Ovaries: This is in to plexus of veins behind the uterus from which the ovarian veins arise. The right ovarian vein opens in to the inferior vena cava and left in to the left renal vein.",
          "Lymph Drainage of the Ovaries: This is to the lateral aortic and preaortic lymph nodes. The lymph vessels follow the same route as the arteries."
