        "clinicalPearl": "**Clinical Pearl:** Encephalitis: An acute inflammation of the brain caused by either a direct attack by any of several viruses or an allergic reaction to any of the many viruses that are normally harmless to the central nervous system. If the virus affects the spinal cord as well, the condition is called \u2018encephalomyelitis\u2019.",
